From cfde2e9c92097572968a8a544f369fc749dee3bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 52/57] tlsfragment: fragment and record_fragment, also on the
 ClientHello of REALITY

The fragmenting of a ClientHello does not hold the socket while it waits for an acknowledgment and
takes a server name with an empty label; fragment and record_fragment act on the hello of REALITY
too.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  d74ad911c tlsfragment: do not hold the socket while waiting for an acknowledgment
  371ce7d1b tlsfragment: a server name with an empty label
  b93828792 reality: fragment and record_fragment act on the ClientHello

Pdk-Feature: record-fragment
Pdk-Zone: protocols
Pdk-Layer: 04
